        "disclosure": "Market xyz:TSLA: builder dex xyz (XYZ), deployed by 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000001;\n    its deployer sets the oracle price (0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000004); isolated margin\n    only; collateral USDC.\n\n\n  · Hyperliquid venue fee: 3x the main exchange's (taker 0.135%, maker 0.045% at the base tier),\n    paid to Hyperliquid and the dex. Candle's builder fee is separate.\n\n\n  ! xyz:TSLA charges 3x the main exchange's fee (its deployer sets it), above Candle's 2x warning\n    line\n\n\n  · Open buy 0.1 asset 110001 at 101 (Ioc).\n\n\n  · Candle builder 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000007 fee: 10 bps.\n\n"
      }
    },
